Package: powersifu
Version: 0.3.5
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tomas Pluharik <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-atspi-2.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, power-profiles-daemon, upower, pkexec, apt, dpkg
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, brightnessctl
Homepage: https://github.com/tpluharik/powersifu
Description: tray-based Linux power-profile automation
 PowerSifu switches power profiles based on AC or battery state, applies
 per-profile display brightness, runs recurring schedules, installs verified
 updates with system authentication, and stops configured same-user applications.
